Muse Plush (dsh-client-ui-skin-muse-plush)
=========================================

Fan-made, unofficial skin for the DeepSeek Harness Web GUI.

- Not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by DeepSeek, Meta, or the
  Muse product. "Muse" here refers to the plush-toy look this skin imitates;
  no claim is made to any third party's name, character or trademark.
- No third-party artwork is bundled. Every visual is generated at runtime from
  original code: the fur texture is drawn with canvas, the mascot and its
  buttons are inline SVG, the fuzzy bubble edges are SVG displacement filters.
  No images, sprites, fonts or audio are shipped in this package.
- If a rights holder objects to this fan work, the package will be unpublished
  on request.

Bundled code is original and licensed MIT (see LICENSE).
